    "bbox": [
      65.05,
      368.91,
      521.84,
      385.12
    ],
    "text": "home after the said incident Danegala Lokka kept waiting in the compound, after",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.767104148864746,
      11.800000190734863
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      64.94,
      401.06,
      522.57,
      417.28
    ],
    "text": "some time, a person called Kaluwa who was very well known to the members of",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
